      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "High rates of maternal mortality and morbidity remain significant health issues in low- and middle-income countries. Despite this, few researchers have investigated the underlying factors of severe maternal complications in sub-Saharan Africa.",
      "reason": "The Background describes the current state of knowledge (high maternal mortality/morbidity in LMICs) and the key uncertainty (few studies of underlying factors of severe maternal complications in sub-Saharan Africa)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "Therefore, the objective of this systematic review was to determine the socioeconomic, demographic, and obstetric predictors of severe maternal complications in this region.",
      "reason": "The rationale and need for the review are explained: because few researchers have investigated these factors, the review was conducted to determine the predictors of severe maternal complications."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e3",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No evidence in the retrieved text indicates that similar systematic reviews exist; the Background presents the review as addressing a gap ('few researchers have investigated'), so no update/replication justification is required."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "This is a review of determinants of maternal near miss, not a review of intervention effects, so no mechanism of action needs to be described."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e5",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The review examines determinants/associations rather than evaluating a complex intervention, so a logic model of intervention components is not applicable."
    }
