      "quote": "This review used the PECO (Population, Exposure, Comparison and Outcomes) approach to research, with the following parameters: Population: Pregnant, labouring, or postpartum women up to 42 days after delivery in Africa... no prior restrictions on study design (qualitative, quantitative, or mixed methods).",
